WEBVTT

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:16.510
North latitude, 28 degrees 24 minutes,

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:20.100
west longitude, 80 degrees 36 minutes.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:23.940
Wait for the next new moon.

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:28.150
Heaven will appear then.

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:31.110
I have no use for this place now.

00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:35.570
The birthed creature now belongs to me.

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:38.030
Jailhouse Lock.

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:41.290
You can only remember
three new pieces of information.

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:43.660
What do I need to do?

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:45.210
What's important to me?

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:47.250
What shouldn't I forget?

00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:51.420
I have things I need to tell Jolyne!

00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:58.470
What am I doing here?

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:02.180
Something's off.

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:12.860
What? Why is this man
going inside the house?

00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:14.940
I have no idea what's going on.

00:01:15.030 --> 00:01:16.570
Bitch!

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:18.780
Stop rewinding it so much!

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:21.450
No shit, now I'm lost too!

00:01:21.530 --> 00:01:23.450
Get this bitch out of here!

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:27.040
Fine, I'll leave.

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:33.460
Greenie, that's the head honcho of
all the other spiders in this cell.

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:37.930
Hello sir, great to meet you.

00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:40.390
I'm Pit Viper Ron.

00:01:40.470 --> 00:01:43.100
Yes, good to meet you.

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:46.600
And this spider right here's
about to croak.

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:49.060
Oh, hey.

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:51.020
The hell?

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:54.030
What's funny about it?

00:01:54.110 --> 00:01:56.950
I don't get this comic at all.

00:01:57.030 --> 00:02:01.490
Oh, why did I come to
this recreation room?

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:05.370
2. YOU CAN ONLY RETAIN
UP TO THREE NEW PIECES OF INFORMATION

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:07.620
That's right… I'm in a predicament.

00:02:08.370 --> 00:02:11.880
I came here to find a way
out of this situation.

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:18.260
The medical wing is beyond this corridor.

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:20.720
The stairs on the way
lead to Emporio's room.

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:22.850
It's usually not a hassle,

00:02:22.930 --> 00:02:25.010
but the area is heavily guarded today.

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:27.640
How can I reach Emporio?

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:41.280
IF ANYONE KEEPS LOOKING AT
MY LEFT HAND, DON'T HESITATE

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:44.120
JUST PUNCH

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:50.750
She has a Stand!

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:52.670
It looks familiar too.

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:55.670
I have to chase it. She's my enemy!

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:57.670
She's the Stand User!

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:35.770
EPISODE 24: JAILBREAK…

00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:10.310
Where… am I?

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:13.390
And who was I trying to chase just now?

00:05:13.470 --> 00:05:14.390
There she is.

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:17.650
-Target found at the corner of D-12-2.
-Hands in the air!

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:21.610
I was wrong, I'm the one being chased!

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:26.490
She's right there! Hey, don't move!

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:34.370
What the…

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:37.460
Was there just one guard
coming from this way?

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:39.960
No, that doesn't matter right now.

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:41.960
Where is this?

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:44.510
Where the hell am I?

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:46.130
Why am I being chased?

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:08.570
Where is she? I swear she ran this way!

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:10.320
Keep looking. We have to find her!

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:11.700
There's no way we lost her.

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:13.530
She must be hiding somewhere close!

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:15.410
She may have ran towards the stairs.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:16.660
That's not possible.

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:19.080
She would have to walk right past us.

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:20.170
Stairs?

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:22.210
"Go see Emporio…"

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:27.050
That's right, that flight of stairs
leads to Emporio's room.

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:46.150
What's going on?

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:49.700
That's right, I spilled some water.

00:06:49.780 --> 00:06:51.950
GO TELL JOLYNE

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:56.370
I have to tell Jolyne.

00:06:57.660 --> 00:06:59.290
I have to print something.

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:01.250
We'll end up forgetting it,

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:04.210
so I have to show her the guard's face.

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:07.760
Or else, I can't tell her.

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:09.010
MEW MEW, AGE 25
LEAD GUARD

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:13.180
Jolyne Cujoh.

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:17.100
You can't retain more than
three new pieces of information.

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:19.480
Even if you saw four guards,

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:22.560
you can't remember more
than three of them.

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:26.110
Even though the fourth guard
is in your line of sight,

00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:29.360
your brain rejects it
since that's too much to remember.

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:35.580
You wanted to go see Emporio,
so I let you guide me here.

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:36.780
So I see.

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:39.160
I didn't know there was a room here.

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:52.590
Emporio!

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:59.180
Jolyne.

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:01.680
-How long have you been here?
-I got here just now.

00:08:01.770 --> 00:08:05.150
Your poor hands. What happened to them?

00:08:05.900 --> 00:08:07.320
The writings on your arms…

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:09.360
You can only remember three new things.

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:11.990
You're in the same boat as I am!

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:13.860
Ever since that time
in the confinement cell!

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:17.120
That's right, I was hoping to see you.

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:21.160
I have to tell you something, Jolyne!

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:23.290
What's this? What was I doing just now?

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:27.290
What? Jolyne?

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:28.790
When did you get here?

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:32.590
-And why did you come?
-Right, why am I here?

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:34.300
-Why?
-Why?

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:37.510
Oh, that's right. I'm here to see you.

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:39.260
I don't know what for,

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:42.480
but there was a really serious reason
for me to come see you.

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:43.940
Print it out.

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:45.940
I have to print something out.

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:48.520
If I don't, it'll be forgotten forever.

00:08:48.610 --> 00:08:50.400
Printing is the only way to remember it.

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:52.400
Print what out, Emporio?

00:08:52.490 --> 00:08:54.450
What are you talking about?

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:57.870
Huh? But how would I do that?

00:08:57.950 --> 00:09:01.120
What was I trying to print out?

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:05.790
"Mew Mew, Lead Guard."

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:08.000
It makes sense now.

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:12.460
So he was with you
when my Stand activated.

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:16.470
He had seen my face and heard me
say my name.

00:09:16.550 --> 00:09:20.010
Emporio was hiding in the walls of
the confinement cell.

00:09:20.510 --> 00:09:22.520
Usually, I'd let him be.

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:28.400
My Jailhouse Lock's job
is to keep Stand Users behind bars.

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:30.400
But if he's trying to leave
a record of me,

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:32.020
then that changes everything.

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:34.280
I now deem you an escapee.

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:45.790
Her Stand, Stone Ocean.
Bullets won't give her a scratch.

00:09:45.870 --> 00:09:52.300
But her memory would have been impaired
had I fired four shots.

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:55.050
Her brain wouldn't even register
the fourth shot,

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:59.260
let alone the smoke from it!

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:02.720
Jolyne…

00:10:03.310 --> 00:10:05.180
What?

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:08.060
I don't know why there's a room
in a place like this,

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:11.190
and what a little boy is doing here.

00:10:11.270 --> 00:10:13.690
But Pale Snake had told me

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:18.110
that Jolyne Cujoh has allies
from the inside who have been helping her

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:20.320
-using walkie-talkies and the like.
-Emporio!

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:22.620
So this little boy was her ally.

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:26.790
And now, any record he had
about me is gone.

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:29.460
I won't forgive you!

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:31.830
Wow, how caring.

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:34.050
But even that anger you feel right now

00:10:34.130 --> 00:10:37.920
will be completely forgotten
with the next three pieces of information.

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:40.840
That's my Stand Jailhouse Lock's ability.

00:10:40.930 --> 00:10:43.930
Take this. Meet your end, Jolyne Cujoh!

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:51.230
You won't be able to see
more than three of the shots.

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:54.190
The others will leave a hole in your body!

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:10.920
An image reflected on water
is the one whole truth.

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:13.330
You might be able to shoot
many shots at once,

00:11:13.420 --> 00:11:16.000
but I can see their reflections
all at once.

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:19.470
I hope you haven't forgotten
about this one.

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:20.840
AVENGE EMPORIO

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:27.310
That bitch…

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:30.140
But I managed to destroy the computer.

00:11:30.230 --> 00:11:32.060
Now, I just have to escape.

00:11:32.730 --> 00:11:36.020
Jolyne will forget about me soon anyway.

00:11:36.110 --> 00:11:38.320
She will never be able to
remember who I am!

00:11:42.610 --> 00:11:44.910
Emporio, hang in there
for just a bit longer.

00:11:44.990 --> 00:11:46.580
I will go after her.

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:51.040
Don't, Jolyne.

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:54.830
You'll forget everything the moment
you step out of this room.

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:58.460
You'll even forget about defeating her.

00:11:58.550 --> 00:11:59.510
So, please…

00:11:59.590 --> 00:12:04.300
Emporio, I understand
why you are so careful.

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:08.260
It was a skill you needed to develop
to survive inside these prison walls.

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:12.180
But there comes a time
when we have to move forward,

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:14.770
even if that means facing danger.

00:12:15.980 --> 00:12:17.820
And for me,

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:20.150
that time is now!

00:12:22.990 --> 00:12:24.200
Is this her string?

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:35.920
STAND NAME: JAILHOUSE LOCK
STAND USER: MEW MEW

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:44.720
Why am I injured?

00:12:45.970 --> 00:12:49.100
But there comes a time
when we have to move forward,

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:51.970
even if that means facing danger.

00:12:52.810 --> 00:12:54.640
I don't know why…

00:12:54.730 --> 00:12:57.980
but I feel like there's something
I have to do…

00:12:58.690 --> 00:12:59.690
What was it?

00:13:01.070 --> 00:13:03.570
That's right, print it out.

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:05.570
I have to tell Jolyne.

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:07.870
I have to print something out…

00:13:09.030 --> 00:13:12.540
but what was I trying to print?

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:16.420
My room doesn't even have a printer.

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:18.380
COMPUTE

00:13:25.590 --> 00:13:27.470
She's strong!

00:13:30.140 --> 00:13:31.640
She is the enemy I'm after.

00:13:32.350 --> 00:13:34.600
I can't let her get away.

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:40.650
I need you back here!

00:13:40.730 --> 00:13:42.360
I'm at the D10 stairwell!

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:48.570
Look, she's over there!

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:50.490
Lead Guard Mew Mew is being assaulted!

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:51.410
The gate!

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:52.620
Open the gate!

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:06.800
This place…

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:09.300
Why am I here?

00:14:11.140 --> 00:14:14.220
Hurry! Capture her!

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:15.930
Am I…

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:17.390
being chased?

00:14:20.230 --> 00:14:22.360
The three guards are here now.

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:27.030
Now, you will never recall that I exist!

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:37.120
Now, try to run away just a little bit.

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:39.580
Then, the guards will shoot you to death.

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:42.330
Before you go, those hands of yours…

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:44.920
I almost forgot that
they can block gunshots.

00:14:53.260 --> 00:14:57.350
My duty is strictly to keep
Stand Users confined in this facility.

00:14:58.390 --> 00:15:00.980
But I feel great right now.

00:15:03.770 --> 00:15:07.280
It feels great to
watch you get shot to death.

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:09.190
Because you brought this upon yourself.

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:13.240
You wanted to walk out of your line,
so this is what you get.

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:14.160
There she is.

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:20.370
And I love that you can't see
more than three guards!

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:23.500
-I've found her!
-There she is!

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:27.670
No one can escape my Jailhouse Lock!

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:33.140
Jolyne…

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:34.510
How long have you been here?

00:15:35.010 --> 00:15:37.260
Emporio, it's you!

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:38.640
I have to tell you…

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:41.980
I have to print this out for you.

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:44.360
If I don't, you won't be able to
remember her.

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:45.730
Print it out?

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:47.820
Binaries.

00:15:47.900 --> 00:15:50.030
These are binaries made up
of ones and zeroes.

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:51.860
I must have computed this.

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:55.370
You can print it correctly.

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:58.990
We are going to imprint it
into your memory!

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:02.580
Stone Ocean!

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:10.630
They're binary numbers.

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:13.300
The binary system can express anything.

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:17.010
Draw zeroes and ones using your thread.

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:18.810
You can use Stone Ocean

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:21.520
as a printer that can express images!

00:16:28.270 --> 00:16:30.990
Can I consider you my enemy?

00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:33.110
Are you an enemy?

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:34.240
What?

00:16:36.240 --> 00:16:37.280
She's talking nonsense.

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:39.240
She can't even see me.

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:42.080
Now, be gone.

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:47.750
Thanks. So I guess
you are an enemy after all.

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:57.800
What's happening?

00:16:59.220 --> 00:17:01.520
She has Mew Mew hostage!

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:02.890
Emporio.

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:06.600
Her Jailhouse Lock is no longer active.

00:17:07.270 --> 00:17:09.860
Yes. I'm okay now.

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:12.900
Great. I'm leaving now.

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:15.860
Like I told you before,
I'm leaving this prison.

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:18.280
What are you going to do?

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:22.410
If you plan on staying here,
then you should go back to your room.

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:31.340
Jolyne, my time to leave is now.

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:33.210
I…

00:17:33.300 --> 00:17:35.090
I want to see the outside world!

00:17:37.380 --> 00:17:39.510
Look, a child.

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:41.680
Why is there a child in prison?

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:43.770
Either way, keep your guard up!

00:17:54.030 --> 00:17:56.400
Come, Emporio. Let's go.

00:17:57.320 --> 00:17:59.570
Excuse me.

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:02.790
Sorry, coming through.

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:08.620
Sorry, excuse me.

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:14.550
What? Who was I trying to gun down?

00:18:14.630 --> 00:18:18.430
-What am I doing here?
-Why am I here?

00:18:19.590 --> 00:18:21.390
Great job, Mew Mew.

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:23.260
I'm glad you understand.

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:28.440
First, we are going to the medical wing
to treat Emporio's wound.

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:32.230
I'm counting on you to keep us safe,
Jailhouse Lock.

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:35.570
An undefeated ability
that restricts the enemy's memory.

00:18:38.780 --> 00:18:40.410
Where… am I?

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:48.330
Do you have my father's disc?

00:18:48.410 --> 00:18:50.870
Yes. I've had it with me the entire time.

00:18:50.960 --> 00:18:52.630
Hey, Jolyne!

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:55.050
It's Jolyne.

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:56.300
Emporio, you too.

00:18:56.380 --> 00:18:57.510
Ermes.

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:04.810
I heard a commotion.
I knew it had to be you guys.

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:06.850
Who is she?

00:19:06.930 --> 00:19:08.980
She is this prison's lead guard.

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:10.310
What?

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:12.600
Does that mean you're…

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:16.610
Yes. We are breaking out.
We're about to leave this place.

00:19:18.360 --> 00:19:19.650
You're going after that priest.

00:19:19.740 --> 00:19:21.160
That's right, Ermes.

00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:26.620
I have to seal what he took.
I'm ready for anything.

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:30.290
Things even worse than
what we faced in this prison.

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:38.960
Take me with you then.

00:20:30.930 --> 00:20:34.810
Father, thank you.

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:37.190
I don't mean to be rude,
but are you feeling okay?

00:20:37.270 --> 00:20:40.150
Yes, I'm just a little tired.

00:20:47.280 --> 00:20:48.580
Are you… sure?

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:53.500
Excuse me.

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:04.760
What is this?

00:21:08.050 --> 00:21:10.560
What's wrong with these eggs?

00:21:12.310 --> 00:21:13.640
A Stand…

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:18.860
Pale Snake is no longer my Stand ability.

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:22.610
Something else is inside me… but what?

00:21:23.190 --> 00:21:25.150
I feel terrible…

00:21:25.240 --> 00:21:28.620
Something is running loose inside me.

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:32.580
This power, it's beyond my control.

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:35.830
But this power carries hope.

00:21:35.910 --> 00:21:39.330
I can at least feel
hope within this power.

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:42.960
Dio's memo inside Jotaro's memory…

00:21:43.550 --> 00:21:46.930
It seems this power needs
the things in that memory.

00:21:47.010 --> 00:21:48.680
Time and place.

00:21:49.930 --> 00:21:52.260
North latitude, 28 degrees 24 minutes.

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:54.850
West longitude, 80 degrees 36 minutes.

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:58.270
That's where heaven will be.

00:21:59.270 --> 00:22:02.650
This location is Cape Canaveral.

00:22:02.730 --> 00:22:04.690
Kennedy Space Center.

00:22:09.030 --> 00:22:10.700
It will be during the new moon.

00:22:11.200 --> 00:22:12.660
Six more days.

00:23:41.290 --> 00:23:46.290
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
